  "description": "A lightweight and high-performance library implementing the Command Query Responsibility Segregation (CQRS) pattern for .NET 10.0. Provides clean architecture and separated responsibilities in modern .NET applications with support for Request/Response, Notifications, and Pipeline Behaviors. Features comprehensive interfaces for dependency injection integration and projector-based query operations.",
